@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = replace-with-access-token

### Game settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/game-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/search?q=ann
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send friend request by user ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/friends/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### List friends
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/friends?page=0&size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List friend leaderboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leaderboard/friends?metric=POINTS
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### WebSocket STOMP flow
# Connect WebSocket client to ws://localhost:8080/ws.
# Send CONNECT with:
# accept-version:1.2
# host:localhost
# Authorization:Bearer <access-token>
# Subscribe:
# /user/queue/game-events
# /user/queue/leaderboard
# Client SEND frames are rejected. Refresh expired JWT, reconnect, resubscribe.
